#. Tag: title
#: details-currencies.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "Currencies"
msgstr "Valute"

#. Tag: para
#: details-currencies.docbook:14
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kappname; supports the use of multiple currencies in different accounts. "
#| "For example, you can set up a bank account in Euros, another in British "
#| "Pounds, and still have your credit card account in US Dollars."
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; supports the use of multiple currencies in different accounts. "
"For example, you can set up a bank account in Euros, another in British "
"Pounds, and still have your credit card account in US Dollars."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; podržava upotrebu više valuta u različitim računima. Npr., možete "
"postaviti bankovni račun u eurima, drugi u britanskim funtama i i dalje "
"možete imati račun kreditne kartice u američkim dolarima."

#. Tag: title
#: details-currencies.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "Base currency"
msgstr "Bazna valuta"

#. Tag: para
#: details-currencies.docbook:23
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Once you create a &kappname; file, you will be asked for the base "
#| "currency. The base currency is the one that all income and expense "
#| "categories use and that reports will be based on. Usually, the base "
#| "currency is the currency you use in your country. If not otherwise "
#| "selected, new accounts will use this currency as the default."
msgid ""
"During the initial &kmymoney; New File Setup, you will be asked to select "
"the base currency. Usually, the base currency is the currency you use in "
"your country. The base currency is the one that all income and expense "
"categories use and that reports will be based on. When you set up a new "
"account &kmymoney; will automatically default to the base currency. If your "
"account requires you to use a different currency, you can change it during "
"the New Account Setup."
msgstr ""
"Kada napravite &kappname; datoteku, od vas će se tražiti da odaberete baznu "
"valutu. Bazna valuta je ona koju će sve prihod i rashod kategorije koristiti "
"i na kojoj će izvještaji biti bazirani. Bazna valuta je uobičajeno valuta "
"koja se koristi u vašoj državi. Ukoliko nije drugačije odabrano, novi računi "
"će koristiti ovu valutu kao unaprijed određenu."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-currencies.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "The select currency dialog"
msgstr "Dijalog biranja valute"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-currencies.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "select currency"
msgstr "biranje valute"

#. Tag: title
#: details-currencies.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding a new currency"
msgstr "Dodavanje nove valute"

#. Tag: para
#: details-currencies.docbook:49
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Although it does not happen often, sometimes a new currency is "
#| "introduced. This can be a new virtual currency, such as Bitcoin, or a "
#| "change introduced by a country for financial policy reasons. While any "
#| "such currency will be added to the next version of &kappname; it is "
#| "possible to add it manually, in case you have a need to begin using it "
#| "immediately."
msgid ""
"Although it does not happen often, sometimes a new currency is introduced. "
"This can be a new virtual currency, such as Bitcoin, or a change introduced "
"by a country for financial policy reasons. While any such currency will be "
"added to the next version of &kmymoney; it is possible to add it manually, "
"in case you have a need to begin using it immediately."
msgstr ""
"Iako se to ne dešava često, ponekad se stvaraju nove valute. To može biti "
"nova virtualna valuta, kao što je Bitcoin, ili promjena uvedena od strane "
"države zbog finansijskih razloga. Iako će sve takve valute biti naknadno "
"dodane u sljedeću verziju &kappname;, vi ih možete dodati odmah, u slučaju "
"da ih morate odmah koristiti."

#. Tag: para
#: details-currencies.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To manually add a currency, select <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Currencies...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to display the "
"<guilabel>Currencies</guilabel> dialog, as shown above. Right click on any "
"existing currency and select <menuchoice><guimenuitem>New currency</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the <menuchoice><guimenu>Currency Options</"
"guimenu></menuchoice> context menu. Enter the official code for the currency "
"and click <guilabel>OK</guilabel>. The currency will be created with the "
"name <quote>New Currency</quote>. To change the name, either press "
"<keycap>F2</keycap> or right click and select "
"<menuchoice><guimenuitem>Rename currency</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste ručno dodali valutu, odaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Alati</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Valute...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> za prikaz "
"<guilabel>Valute</guilabel> dijaloga, kao što je gore prikazano. Desni klik "
"na bilo koju postojeću valutu i odaberite  <menuchoice><guimenuitem>New "
"currency</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz <menuchoice><guimenu>Opcije Valute</"
"guimenu></menuchoice> kontekstnog menija. Unesite oficijalni znak valute i "
"kliknite <guilabel>U redu</guilabel>. Valuta će biti napravljena imenom "
"<quote>Nova valuta</quote>. Za promjenu imena, pritisnite <keycap>F2</"
"keycap> ili desni klik i odaberite <menuchoice><guimenuitem>Preimenuj "
"valutu</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: details-currencies.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "Account setup"
msgstr "Postavka računa"

#. Tag: para
#: details-currencies.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you create a new account, you specify the currency in which it will be "
"managed. The New Account wizard defaults this setting to the <link linkend="
"\"details.currencies.basecurrency\">base currency</link>. If you require a "
"different currency, you need to select it during this initial setup. The "
"ledger for the account will then show all values in the selected currency."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: details-currencies.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "Entering transactions using different currencies"
msgstr "Unos transakcija koristeći različite valute"

#. Tag: para
#: details-currencies.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Whenever a transaction is entered that refers to more than one currency, the "
"exchange rate editor pops up and allows you to enter an exchange rate. "
"Initially, the current price available from the price database will be used "
"as exchange rate. See <link linkend=\"details.currencies.prices\">Entering "
"exchange rates for currencies</link> for more information on how to provide "
"exchange rates manually and obtain online price information."
msgstr ""
"Svaki put kad je unesena transakcija koja sadrži više različitih valuta, "
"urednik razmjene iskače i omogućava vam da sami unesete tečaj. Inicijalno, "
"trenutna vrijednost dostupna iz baze podataka vrijednosti če se koristiti "
"kao tečaj. Pogledajte <link linkend=\"details.currencies.prices\">Unos "
"kursne liste za valutu</link> za više informacija o tome kako da promjenite "
"tečaje samostalno i da dobijete informacije o online cijenama."

#. Tag: para
#: details-currencies.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Optionally, the exchange rate is saved in the price database once entered by "
"the user."
msgstr ""
"Opcionalno, tečaj će biti sačuvan u bazu podataka cijena kada bude unesen od "
"strane korisnika."

#. Tag: title
#: details-currencies.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exchange rates for currencies"
msgstr "Tečajevi za valute"

#. Tag: title
#: details-currencies.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid "Entering prices manually"
msgstr "Unos cijena ručno"

#. Tag: para
#: details-currencies.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The price database editor allows you to enter exchange rates between "
"currencies or prices for investments. You can pull it up using the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Prices...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> menu option."
msgstr ""
"Urednik baze podataka cijena vam omogućava da unesete tečajeve između valuta "
"ili cijena za investiciju. Možete ga otvoriti koristeći "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Alati</guimenu><guimenuitem>Cijene...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> opciju menija."

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-currencies.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid "Currency Price Editor"
msgstr "Urednik vrijednosti valute"

#. Tag: para
#: details-currencies.docbook:128
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In &kappname; a <quote>Price</quote> is the price of one currency in "
#| "terms of a second currency. For example, as I write this, the price of 1 "
#| "USD in terms of 1 EUR is 0.83; that is, 1 USD costs 0.83 EUR. The first "
#| "currency is the one being bought or sold, and the second one is the "
#| "currency used to buy or sell it."
msgid ""
"In &kmymoney; a <quote>Price</quote> is the price of one currency in terms "
"of a second currency. For example, as I write this, the price of 1 USD in "
"terms of 1 EUR is 0.83; that is, 1 USD costs 0.83 EUR. The first currency is "
"the one being bought or sold, and the second one is the currency used to buy "
"or sell it."
msgstr ""
"U &kappname; <quote>Cijena</quote> je vrijednost jedne valute izražene "
"pomoću druge valute. Npr., vrijednost 1 ISD je izraženo u EUR je 0.83; "
"odnosno 1 USD ima istu vrijednost kao 0.83 EUR. Prva valuta se ili kupuje "
"ili prodaje, a druga valuta se koristi da bi se prodala ili kupila prva."

#. Tag: para
#: details-currencies.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you press the <guibutton>New</guibutton> button, you get the New Price "
"Entry dialog. Enter the first currency (USD in the example above) in the "
"Security field. Enter the second currency (EUR in the example above) in the "
"Currency field. Enter the effective date of the price in the Date field."
msgstr ""
"Kada pritisnete <guibutton>Novi</guibutton> dugme, otvara se dijalog za unos "
"nove cijeni. Unesite prvu valutu (USD u primjeru iznad) u sigurnosnom polju. "
"Unesite drugu vrijednost (EUR u primjeru iznad) u polje valute. Unesite "
"efektivni datum vrijednosti u polju datuma."

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-currencies.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid "New Price Entry"
msgstr "Unos nove vrijednosti"

#. Tag: title
#: details-currencies.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid "Online currency updates"
msgstr "Online ažuriranje vrijednosti"

#. Tag: para
#: details-currencies.docbook:160
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kappname; will fetch currency conversions from the web. Once you have "
#| "entered a single price for a pair of currencies, the online quote feature "
#| "will always list that pair amongst its options."
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; will fetch currency conversions from the web. Once you have "
"entered a single price for a pair of currencies, the online quote feature "
"will always list that pair amongst its options."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; će koristiti konverziju valuta sa interneta. Kada unesete jednu "
"vrijednost za par valuta, \"online citat\" svojstvo će uvijek izlistati taj "
"par među svojim opcijama."

#. Tag: para
#: details-currencies.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"See the section on <link linkend=\"details.investments.onlinequotes\">Online "
"Price Quotes</link> in the Investments chapter for more details."
msgstr ""
"Pogledajte sekciju <link linkend=\"details.investments.onlinequotes"
"\">Cjenovnik na mreži</link> u Investicijskom poglavlju za više detalja."

